Upstream-Name: meta-variscite-bsp-ti
Source: https://github.com/varigit/meta-variscite-bsp-ti
Comment: The upstream bcm43xx-utils Yocto recipe is in
 meta-variscite-bsp-common; only the VAR-SOM-AM62 implementation from
 meta-variscite-bsp-ti is included in this Debian source package.
 The AM62-specific udev rules are also included to provide the device links
 required by these scripts on Debian.

